OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies in crash following police
OL,4,Apursuit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died and a woman has been
OL,7,Fseriously hurt in a crash following a
OL,8,Fpolice pursuit near
OL,9,FStratford-upon-Avon.
OL,11,FWarwickshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fattempted to stop a black Audi on
OL,13,FBirmingham Road shortly before 17:30
OL,14,FBST on Monday but the driver failed to
OL,15,Fpull over and a pursuit began.
OL,17,FFifteen minutes later the Audi crashed,
OL,18,Fthe force said, into a white Ford Puma,
OL,19,Fwith the Audi's male driver confirmed
OL,20,Fdead at the scene by paramedics.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
